              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Nd’ Umuyuda, navukiye i Taruso h’i Kilikiya, ariko nakuriye mur’ iki gisagara, nigishirizwa imbere y’ibirenge vya Gamaliyeli nk’uk’ uruhande rugoye rw’ivyagezwe vya ba sogokuruza ruri, ngira ishaka ry’Imana, nk’uko namwe mwese murifise uyu musi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
